# Lasting Tarfire: "At the beginning of each end step, if you put a counter on a creature this turn, this enchantment deals 2
# damage to each opponent." Bot1 casts Tarfire on turn 3 and attacks with Gau, which puts a +1/+1 counter on itself: Gau
# deals 3 in combat (Bot2 at 17) and Tarfire 2 more at the end step (15). The counter was put on turn 3 only, so Bot2's own
# end step on turn 4 does not trigger it again (still 15, not 13).

